                                      "kind": "frame",
                                      "layout": "vertical",
                                      "children": [
                                        {
                                          "id": "bf-ms-p1",
                                          "kind": "text",
                                          "text": "凌晨一点，夜航小馆的后厨还亮着灯。阿哲在挑今天的第二锅骨汤，勺子提起来，汤面上那层油光要刚好能挂住。",
                                          "fontSize": "$text-manuscript",
                                          "fontWeight": 400,
                                          "fontFamily": "$font-manuscript",
                                          "lineHeight": {
                                            "unit": "multiplier",
                                            "value": 1.75
                                          },
                                          "wrap": "width",
                                          "fill": "$color-ink",
                                          "width": "fill_container",
                                          "height": "fit_content"
                                        },
                                        {
                                          "id": "bf-ms-p2",
                                          "kind": "text",
                                          "text": "「深夜的客人不挑味道，挑的是有没有人等。」他说这话时，门外刚坐下第三拨客人——代驾、下夜班的护士、还有一个抱着电脑改方案的设计师。",
                                          "fontSize": "$text-manuscript",
                                          "fontWeight": 400,
                                          "fontFamily": "$font-manuscript",
                                          "lineHeight": {
                                            "unit": "multiplier",
                                            "value": 1.75
                                          },
                                          "wrap": "width",
                                          "fill": "$color-ink",
                                          "width": "fill_container",
                                          "height": "fit_content"
                                        },
                                        {
                                          "id": "bf-ms-p3",
                                          "kind": "text",
                                          "text": "这一季我们把关门时间从 23 点挪到凌晨 2 点，菜单只加了两个热菜。生意不是变多了，是变长了。",
                                          "fontSize": "$text-manuscript",
                                          "fontWeight": 400,
                                          "fontFamily": "$font-manuscript",
                                          "lineHeight": {
                                            "unit": "multiplier",
                                            "value": 1.75
                                          },
                                          "wrap": "width",
                                          "fill": "$color-ink",
                                          "width": "fill_container",
                                          "height": "fit_content"
                                        }
